    "long_instructions": "## Wireframe Layouts\r\n\r\nChoose from one of the layouts in the `wireframes` folder to customize the layout of your webpage!\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Click the `wireframes` folder to expand it. There are 4 wireframe options to select from\r\n- Choose the one you like the most, then click the &nbsp; <i class=\"fa-solid fa-ellipsis-v\"></i> &nbsp; icon and select \"Add to AI Tutor Chat\"\r\n- Tell AI Tutor to use this wireframe for the layout of the webpage\r\n\r\n![](https://images.code.org/b11ab8013cc97237b3dc230fad6ab2c8-image-1773951248360.png)",
